      "description": "Read-only native progress bar and tabular elapsed/total times.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-timebar\"><span>0:14</span><progress value=\"14\" max=\"58\" aria-label=\"演唱进度\"></progress><span>0:58</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-timebar{font-family:\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#203746);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:11px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;width:360px}.ds-timebar progress{appearance:none;width:100%;height:4px;border:0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--line,#d7d3c3);overflow:hidden}.ds-timebar progress::-webkit-progress-bar{background:var(--line,#d7d3c3)}.ds-timebar progress::-webkit-progress-value{background:var(--coral,#bd4930);border-radius:3px}.ds-timebar progress::-moz-progress-bar{background:var(--coral,#bd4930)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Playback transport",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "playback-transport",
      "description": "Cream transport surface combines current piece context and a coral action.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-transport\" aria-label=\"播放控制\"><div class=\"ds-now\"><strong>微光慢板</strong><span>Pollen Robotics 官方原创</span></div><button class=\"ds-primary\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 11 7-11 7V5Z\"/></svg><span>开始合唱</span></button></section>",
      "css": ".ds-transport{font-family:\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#203746);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;padding:16px 24px;background:var(--paper,#fff7e7);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 8px 28px #264b4520;min-height:88px}.ds-now{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.ds-now strong{font-size:15px;font-weight:800}.ds-now span{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted,#566971)}.ds-primary{border:0;cursor:pointer;font-family:\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#203746);background:var(--coral,#bd4930);color:var(--paper,#fff7e7);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;padding:15px 23px;min-width:147px;min-height:52px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800}.ds-primary svg{width:18px;height:18px}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#9e3824;filter:brightness(.96)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--coral,#bd4930);outline-offset:4px}.ds-primary:disabled{opacity:.65;cursor:wait}"
    },
    {
      "name": "About card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "about-card",
      "description": "Non-modal source and explanatory surface with a named close action.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-about\" aria-label=\"关于合唱\"><div class=\"ds-about-heading\"><h2>四种声音，一场小小合唱。</h2><button class=\"ds-close\" aria-label=\"关闭说明\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6\"/></svg></button></div><p>声音在浏览器中实时合成，嘴部和头部跟随同一乐谱时钟。坐姿为运动学展示。</p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZsSoyMcggpU\">观看参考视频</a></section>",
      "css": ".ds-about{font-family:\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#203746);max-width:410px;padding:22px 25px;background:var(--paper,#fff7e7);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 16px 50px #264b4530}.ds-about-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}.ds-about h2{font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;margin:0}.ds-about p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.85;color:#41545e}.ds-about a{font-size:11px;color:#873a27;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-close{border:0;cursor:pointer;font-family:\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#203746);width:44px;height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:10px;flex-shrink:0;background:transparent;border-radius:9px}.ds-close svg{width:21px;height:21px}.ds-close:hover{background:#eee5d1;filter:brightness(.96)}.ds-close:focus-visible,.ds-about a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--coral,#bd4930);outline-offset:4px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "奶油搪瓷街机 · Enamel Toy Sports Arcade",
    "overview": "奶油操作件、海蓝文字与珊瑚动作色继承 MicroDuck Arcade 的玩具街机身份。合唱团把同一套搪瓷语法移到安静的排练空间：薄荷色环境、圆形木地板、四只保持真实模型比例的坐姿机器鸭。Bungee 字标带来熟悉的游戏感，中文系统字体让操作直接可读。\n\n这是独立合唱应用当前实现的设计记录。三维演员承担表现力，节目单、试听声部与播放条承担清晰的操作层级。温暖日光、材质与投影建立舞台深度；界面保持不透明、紧凑、可触摸。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "暖奶油操作件、海蓝文字与选中态、珊瑚主要操作，延续现有街机身份。",
      "Bungee 仅用于 DUCK! 字标；曲名、说明与交互标签使用中文系统无衬线。",
      "薄荷背景上的圆形木质舞台，淡紫、石墨、天蓝与象牙四色坐姿小鸭。",
      "桌面控件围绕舞台，手机依次堆叠舞台、节目单、声部与播放条。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Meaningful Accent Rule",
        "body": "珊瑚表示播放主操作；海蓝表示当前曲目和独唱声部，状态同时用文字与 aria-pressed 表达。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Display Role Rule",
        "body": "Bungee 保留给 DUCK! 字标，中文标题和交互标签使用系统字体。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Stage Rule",
        "body": "把持续操作放在演员周围，让四只小鸭的头部与嘴部保持可见；窄屏通过文档堆叠容纳操作。",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 延续奶油操作件、海蓝选中态与珊瑚主要操作，沿用当前字体、圆角和间距。",
      "Do 让节目单和声部通过文字、可见焦点与 aria-pressed 共同表达状态。",
      "Do 在手机上保留清晰的四鸭舞台，并让节目单、试听和播放控制自然向下滚动。",
      "Do 让声部指示、嘴部与头部表现跟随同一音频时钟，并尊重减少动态效果偏好。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 让帮助说明或持久面板覆盖四只小鸭的头部与嘴部。",
      "Don't 把声部身份仅交给颜色；保留低音、次中音、中音、高音和英文标签。",
      "Don't 给普通控件混用字符箭头或图标字体；沿用内联 SVG 的统一描边。",
      "Don't 把舞台的木质和小鸭配色扩散成操作面板的新皮肤；共享的搪瓷语法保持稳定。"
    ]
  }
}
